  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-Asia Aviation Partnership Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action consists of technical cooperation in the field of civil aviation to further develop safe, sustainable and resilient air connectivity in Asia. It will address significant aviation markets in North and South Asia and focus on partnership and capacity building for safe and sustainable aviation. The action will support regional cooperation and integration, notably in South Asia and will promote a level playing field and foster market opportunities for EU aviation industry.</narrative>
  </description>
